The password blocklist of the accounts package (packages/accounts/src/crypto/blocklist.ts) is
generated by packages/accounts/scripts/gen-blocklist.ts from SecLists
(https://github.com/danielmiessler/SecLists), file
Passwords/Common-Credentials/xato-net-10-million-passwords-1000000.txt at commit
10a38f6cbe8ed6b89d55348756eff7486cd0f0ea, downloaded from
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/danielmiessler/SecLists/10a38f6cbe8ed6b89d55348756eff7486cd0f0ea/Passwords/Common-Credentials/xato-net-10-million-passwords-1000000.txt
(SHA-256 424a3e03a17df0a2bc2b3ca749d81b04e79d59cb7aeec8876a5a3f308d0caf51). The list derives from
the ten million passwords xato.net released in 2015. Only its entries of 12 characters or more,
and those of 8 to 11 characters among its first 100,000 lines, are kept, in normalized form (NFKC,
lower case). SecLists is licensed under the MIT License:

